<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-5859] IgniteUtils.ceilPow2 overflow for values greater than 2^30</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-5859</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Method &quot;IgniteUtils.ceilPow2&quot; can overflow for values greater than 2^30 and return Integer.MIN_VALUE for them.&lt;br/&gt;
Maybe this check was skipped for method speed. In this case, we need to add information about this into javaDoc.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
